      "text": "Adam said, This is now bone of my bones, Gen. 2:23 (Moses 3:23; Abr. 5:17). ye shall carry up my bones from hence, Gen. 50:25 (Ex. 13:19). neither … break a bone, Ex. 12:46. Moses took the bones of Joseph with him, Ex. 13:19 (Josh. 24:32). touched the bones of Elisha, 2 Kgs. 13:21. My bone cleaveth to my skin, Job 19:20. all his bones: not one of them is broken, Ps. 34:20 (John 19:36). to thy navel, and marrow to thy bones, Prov. 3:8 (D&C 89:18). bring out the bones of the kings of Judah, Jer. 8:1. the midst of the valley which was full of bones, Ezek. 37:1.",
